      "content": "Reviewers asked for 'a network analysis' of our placenta study. We have mRNA-seq and small-RNA-seq from 45 preeclampsia and control placentas. Honestly I don't know what kind of network they expect or what it's supposed to show. The two groups are roughly balanced and both libraries come from the same placentas; can you set something up that would satisfy them?"
